{"retcode":0,"message":"OK","data":{"page":{"id":"6110","name":"荒泷极意堂堂斗虫大试合","desc":"3.4版本活动 荒泷极意堂堂斗虫大试合","icon_url":"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2023/02/16/4521515/c31ed9526ebff4219007969ab5711777_1114378731630553910.jpg","header_img_url":"","modules":[{"name":"荒泷极意堂堂斗虫大试合","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"collapse_panel","layout":"","data":"{\"rich_text\":\"\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; min-height: 1.5em; text-align: center;\\\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\\\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2023/02/16/4521515/7607f344a175f70de2fe2031cf951070_8169363837909258631.png\\\" href=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"vertical-align:middle;\\\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\",\"switch\":false,\"is_show_switch\":false}\n","style":""}],"id":"1311","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":true,"switch":true,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"活动说明","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"collapse_panel","layout":"","data":"{\"rich_text\":\"\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap;\\\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color:rgba(51,51,51,1)\\\"\u003e〓活动时间〓\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap;\\\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color:rgba(173,114,14,1)\\\"\u003e2023/02/16 10:00 ~ 2023/02/27 03:59\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; min-height: 1.5em;\\\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap;\\\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color:rgba(51,51,51,1)\\\"\u003e〓活动奖励〓\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; min-height: 1.5em;\\\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\\\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2023/02/16/4521515/a9aded550a5e14e34257745e1f58255a_534609049897811824.png\\\" href=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"vertical-align:middle;\\\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap;\\\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color:rgba(51,51,51,1)\\\"\u003e〓参与条件〓\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap;\\\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color:rgba(173,114,14,1)\\\"\u003e冒险等阶≥30级\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap;\\\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color:rgba(173,114,14,1)\\\"\u003e且完成魔神任务「离岛逃离计划」\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap;\\\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color:rgba(51,51,51,1)\\\"\u003e※ 完成魔神任务「危途疑踪」后体验更佳。\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap;\\\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color:rgba(51,51,51,1)\\\"\u003e※ 活动期间，如果没有完成魔神任务「危途疑踪」，可在活动界面通过「快速体验」参与活动。\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; min-height: 1.5em;\\\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap;\\\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color:rgba(51,51,51,1)\\\"\u003e〓活动说明〓\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap;\\\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color:rgba(17,17,17,1)\\\"\u003e● 活动开始后，每天都会解锁一关斗虫挑战，共5关。\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap;\\\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color:rgba(17,17,17,1)\\\"\u003e● 每关斗虫挑战均有\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color:rgba(51,51,51,1)\\\"\u003e「切磋」、「锐意」、「狂热」\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color:rgba(17,17,17,1)\\\"\u003e3个难度。挑战开启后，\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color:rgba(51,51,51,1)\\\"\u003e「切磋」和「锐意」难度会解锁。成功挑战「锐意」难度后才可解锁「狂热」难度。\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap;\\\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color:rgba(17,17,17,1)\\\"\u003e● 迎接对手的挑战，\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color:rgba(51,51,51,1)\\\"\u003e达成相应条件后即可在活动界面领取奖励。完成更高难度的挑战，可直接获得较低难度模式的奖励。\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\",\"switch\":false,\"is_show_switch\":false}\n","style":""}],"id"